        "verbling": {
            "name": "verbling",
            "title": "Verbling – Online Language Tutoring Platform",
            "description": "Research / Visual Design, UX Design",
            "preview": 0,
            "default": 1,
            "images": [
                "./src/images/articles/Verbling/preview_0.png",
                "./src/images/articles/Verbling/preview_1.png",
                "./src/images/articles/Verbling/preview_2.png",
                "./src/images/articles/Verbling/preview_3.png",
                "./src/images/articles/Verbling/preview_4.png"
            ],
            "video": "./src/videos/Verbling/preview.mp4",
            "customer": [
                "Project",
                "Verbling, Chegg, EdTech, US"
            ],
            "type": "education",
            "links": [{
                "name": "verbling.com",
                "href": "https://www.verbling.com"
            }],
            "text": [
                "<div><h3>About</h3>Verbling is an online platform that connects language learners with qualified language teachers for live video lessons. The platform offers a variety of languages and provides tools for scheduling, conducting, and reviewing lessons.</div>",
                "<div>\n <img src=\"./src/images/articles/Verbling/preview_1.gif\" width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\">",
                "<div><h3>Project details</h3>In this project, I was responsible for conducting user research to understand the needs and pain points of both learners and teachers. I performed user testing using usertesting.com, conducted interviews with users via Intercom, and gathered quantitative data through user surveys. Based on these comprehensive insights, I created wireframes and prototypes to enhance the user experience. The final visual design not only made the platform more intuitive and engaging for users but also contributed to achieving key business OKRs by significantly boosting user engagement and conversion rates.</div>",
                "<div>\n <img src=\"./src/images/articles/Verbling/short/preview_2.png\" width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\">",
                "<div><h3>Onboarding</h3>The onboarding initiative for Verbling is designed to provide new users with a clear, intuitive introduction to the platform before registration, enabling them to quickly understand its value proposition and efficiently connect with a suitable teacher, ultimately increasing user engagement and registration rates.</div>",
                "<div>\n <img src=\"./src/images/articles/Verbling/short/preview_4.png\" width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\">",
                "<div style=\"width: 100%; margin: 20px auto; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><h2 style=\"text-align: center; color: #333;\"></h2><table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;\"><thead><tr style=\"background-color: #f4f4f4;\"><th style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px; text-align: left;\">Metric</th><th style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px; text-align: left;\">Value</th><th style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px; text-align: left;\">Additional Info</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr style=\"background-color: #fff;\"><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px;\">Reg:FT Conversion</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px;\">13.00%</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px;\"></td></tr><tr style=\"background-color: #f9f9f9;\"><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px;\">Hypothesis</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px;\">14%</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px;\"></td></tr><tr style=\"background-color: #fff;\"><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px;\">Registrations in Q1</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px;\">29249</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px;\"></td></tr><tr style=\"background-color: #f9f9f9;\"><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px;\">Improved Registrations</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px;\">31499</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px;\"></td></tr><tr style=\"background-color: #fff;\"><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px;\">Difference</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px;\">2250</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px;\"></td></tr><tr style=\"background-color: #f9f9f9;\"><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px;\">Reg:FO Conversion</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px;\">10%</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px;\"></td></tr><tr style=\"background-color: #fff;\"><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px;\">First Orders</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px;\">225</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px;\"></td></tr><tr style=\"background-color: #f9f9f9;\"><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px;\">AOV</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px;\">$145</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px;\"></td></tr><tr style=\"background-color: #fff;\"><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px;\">Additional First Order Revenue</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px;\">$32,624</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px;\"></td></tr><tr style=\"background-color: #f9f9f9;\"><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px;\">Additional First Orders / day</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px;\">2.5</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px;\">10.30%</td></tr><tr style=\"background-color: #fff;\"><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px;\">H2 First Orders Revenue</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px;\">$65,248</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px;\"></td></tr><tr style=\"background-color: #f9f9f9;\"><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px;\">Additional Registrations / day</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px;\">25</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px;\"></td></tr><tr style=\"background-color: #fff;\"><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px;\">Q1 FO Revenue</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px;\">$435,912</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px;\"></td></tr><tr style=\"background-color: #f9f9f9;\"><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px;\">Q1 Total Revenue</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px;\"><strong>$2,582,281</strong></td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px;\"></td></tr><tr style=\"background-color: #fff;\"><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px;\">% FO Revenue / Total Revenue</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px;\">16.88%</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px;\"></td></tr><tr style=\"background-color: #f9f9f9;\"><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px;\">Revenue Equivalent</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px;\">$193,259</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px;\"></td></tr></tbody></table></div>",
                "<div>\n <img src=\"./src/images/articles/Verbling/short/preview_5.png\" width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\">",
                "<div><h3>Dashboard</h3>The dashboard simplification initiative is designed to create a clear, guided space that directs users—especially new ones—toward their next steps in the learning experience by providing actionable prompts such as what to do next and easy access to update onboarding answers (including language preferences, reason for learning, current level, goal, and reminders), with the hypothesis that this will improve the conversion from free trial to first order by 10%, resulting in an estimated increase of 1.8 new orders per day (an 8% uplift) and generating approximately $48k in additional first orders revenue in H2.</div>",
                "<div>\n <img src=\"./src/images/articles/Verbling/short/preview_1.png\" width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\">",
                "<div>Additionally, there were plans to integrate with Busuu's service, aiming to leverage its robust language learning resources to create a more cohesive and enriched learning ecosystem that enhances user engagement and delivers a seamless, multi-platform experience.</div>",
                "<div>\n <img src=\"./src/images/articles/Verbling/short/preview_6.png\" width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\">",
                "<div style=\"max-width: 100%; margin: 20px auto; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;\"><thead><tr style=\"background-color: #f4f4f4;\"><th style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px;\">Metric</th><th style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px;\">Value</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px; font-weight: bold; background-color: #e0e0e0;\">Baseline</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px;\">Old Package Seen</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px;\">1125</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px;\">% Conversion OPSeen/OPSelected</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px;\">38%</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px;\">Old Package Selected</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px;\">428</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px;\">% Conversion OPSelected/First Order</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px;\">74.07%</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px;\">First Orders</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px;\">317</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px; font-weight: bold; background-color: #e0e0e0;\">Hypothesis</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px;\">% Conversion OPSeen/OPSelected</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px;\">42%</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px;\">Old Package Selected</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px;\">471</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px;\">% Conversion OPSelected/First Order</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px;\">74%</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px;\">First Orders</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px;\">349</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px;\">Difference</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px;\">32</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px;\">Equivalent H2</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px;\">190.2</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px;\">Equivalent Daily</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px;\">1.1 (4.40%)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px;\">Revenues H2 (Impact)</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px;\">$27,579</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px; font-weight: bold; background-color: #e0e0e0;\">Business Metrics</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px;\">First Orders Revenue / month</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px;\">$4,597</td></tr></tbody></table></div>",
                "<div><h3>Tutor’s card</h3>The updated tutor card design consolidates key information to help users quickly identify the right teacher for their learning style and goals. It displays the teacher’s language alongside an accurate country of origin flag—addressing the current confusion of generic icons—and highlights the top three badges based on quality filters. Additional enhancements include hover details on the Certified badge to clarify its significance compared to a verified tutor, as well as integrated review snippets and review badges in expanded cards. These changes collectively streamline the teacher discovery process, ensuring both new and returning users receive relevant, actionable insights at a glance.</div>",
                "<div>\n <img src=\"./src/images/articles/Verbling/short/preview_7.png\" width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\">",
                "<div style=\"max-width: 100%; margin: 20px auto; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;\"><thead><tr style=\"background-color: #f4f4f4;\"><th style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px;\">Metric</th><th style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px;\">Enabled</th><th style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px;\">Disabled</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td colspan=\"3\" style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px; font-weight: bold; background-color: #e0e0e0;\">Baseline Metrics</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px;\">Start</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px;\">6237</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px;\">7065</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px;\">Complete</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px;\">104</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px;\">98</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px;\">Conversion</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px;\">1.67%</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px;\">1.39%</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\" style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px; font-weight: bold; background-color: #e0e0e0;\">Uplift Metrics</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px;\">Uplift pp</td><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px;\">0.28%</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px;\">Uplift %</td><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px;\">20.21%</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px;\">Standard Error</td><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px;\">0.21%</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px;\">Z-score</td><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px;\">1.31</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px;\">p value</td><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px;\">0.1895 (Not Significant)</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\" style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px; font-weight: bold; background-color: #e0e0e0;\">Uplift Range</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px;\">Uplift Range pp</td><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px;\">Low: -0.14%, Mid: 0.28%, High: 0.70%</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px;\">Uplift Range %</td><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px;\">Low: -9.98%, Mid: 20.21%, High: 50.40%</td></tr></tbody></table></div>",
                "<div><h3>Summary</h3>Throughout the project, numerous initiatives were undertaken to enhance the UI and UX of the service, with a strong focus on improving the experience for end users. Although not every solution proved successful and support for the service eventually waned, the majority of these efforts were aimed at optimizing the user experience and creating a more intuitive interface, ultimately contributing to better engagement with the platform.</div>"
            ],
